{"redo_booking_notes":"Please meet 15 minutes PRIOR to tour start time.

In order for you to have a wonderful experience at the asylum, can you please follow these new instructions:
1. Do not use Grano Street ;
2. Navigate to the Western Highway – if you are travelling from the Ballarat, Heath St will be on your right (it is the last street on your right before you arrive in Ararat and is directly off the Western Highway). If you are travelling from the Ararat side of the Western Highway, Heath Street will be the first street on your left as you leave the township and travel along the Western Highway;
3. When you enter Heath Street, you will know you are on the correct street when you drive over a rail-line as soon as you enter the street; and
4. Drive along Heath Street, past the large gates, until you arrive at the parking area and front door of the asylum.

Please remember to arrive no later than 15 minutes before your tour is scheduled, and allow lots of time just in case you get lost.

It would be to your advantage to check Google Maps to see where you are going, or set your GPS to Heath Street prior to leaving home.

Please DO NOT be late, as tours START ON TIME AND CANNOT WAIT. (For people who are late, Eerie Tours starts all tours on time and will not refund or rebook those who are late).

