{"redo_booking_notes":"The tour commences with a virtual look into the farming and factory processing before heading out into the orchard and learning about the history, growing and sustainable practises used in the industry. This hands on experience gives you the opportunity to try a hand harvester, try the different types of cracking implements and of course taste all the different flavours (including exclusive sample from the Orchard Table café and the chocolatiers room).

Included in this experience is a picnic prepared by our onsite café including fresh, seasonal and local produce from the region including our premium macadamias, bottled water will also be supplied as well as s spot will be set-up in the orchard for you to enjoy the offering.

